pdf-to-html.formula:
line_y = round(transform[5])          (baseline position)
paragraph_break = empty line OR line ends with . ! ? … : ;

Text fragments are sorted top-to-bottom by Y, then left-to-right by X within each line. Lines ending in sentence punctuation (or separated by blank space) start a new <p>. This is a heuristic — PDFs store positioned glyphs, not paragraphs.
